{room, key=cruise_ship, name=Cruise Ship
    {attrib, output=true, tags=tested }
    {attrib, output=false, tags=greeted }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
South, the hall continues into the heart of the cruise ship.
North, exits the cruise ship.
        }
    }


    {enter_message
        output={@
<?[self]((greeted)) = 'false'?>
You step aboard the cruise ship and are immediately surrounded
by purple neon glow.
Synth music pulses through the air and the excitement of vacation
is palpable.

A virtual woman approaches you with a smile on her slightly
translucent face.
"Welcome aboard! May I see your ticket?"

You hand her your ticket.

"Ah. Your room is 201. To get there, go down to the below decks.

However...

I will need you to make your way up to the top
deck for the required muster drill. Thank you and have a fun
vacation!"

Then she walks off to greet other travelers.
<else>
You return to the cruise ship's entrance.

<?[player]((quest)) = 'Attend the muster drill'?>
You must attend the muster drill on the top deck.
</?>
</?>
        }

        {set, logic=[player]((quest)), output=Attend the muster drill }
        {set, logic=[self]((greeted)), output=true }

        {logic, name=Cruise ship entrance, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@
You look around the cruise ship.
You are surrounded by purple neon glow.
Synth music pulses through the air.

<?[player]((quest)) = 'Attend the muster drill'?>
You must attend the muster drill on the top deck.
</?>
            }
        }
    }



    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_north))
        {move, logic=vice_port_tickets_done, tags=[player]
            output={@
You exit the cruise ship back to the ticket booth.
            }
        }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_south))
        {move, logic=cruise_central_area, tags=[player]
            output={@
You go deeper into the heart of the cruise ship.
            }
        }
    }


    {dev_note, tags=TODO
        output={@
Clear out the muster drill - and award the player if they attend.
        }
    }
    {dev_note, tags=TODO
        output={@
When returning to the ticket booth, go to a completely different room -
that is a blocked off variant of the ticket booth. If the player leaves
the cruise ship - they cannot return to it.
        }
    }
}
